{"Ba":[{"id":"Ba","headword":"भ","headword_slp1":"Ba","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"भ (vb. भा),\n I. n.\n 1. A star, Bhāg. "},{"t":"cite","s":"P. 3, 17, 14.\n 2","q":"P"},{"t":"txt","s":". A lunar asterism. []\n 3. A planet.\n II. m. A name of the planet Venus.\n III. f. भा, see s. v."}]}]},{"id":"BA","headword":"भा","headword_slp1":"BA","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. भा भा, ii. 2, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Par.\n 1","q":"Par.\n"},{"t":"txt","s":". To shine, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Kir. 5, 20.\n 2","q":"Kir"},{"t":"txt","s":". To appear, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rājat. 5, 94","q":"Rājat"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. भात, Bright. n. Morning.\n --With the prep. अभि अभि, To shine from every part, Ghaṭ. 10. []\n --With अव अव, To shine, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 3, 10094","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With आ आ,\n 1. To shine forth, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 288, 9","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":" = Rigv. i. 48, 9.\n 2. To illuminate, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 289, 4","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":" = Rigv. i. 50, 4.\n 3. To shine, Rām. i. 15, 19.\n 4. To appear, Vikr. d. 142; "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 3, 13701","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With उद् उद्, To shine forth, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 1, 7","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With निस् निस्,\n 1. To shine forth, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 5, 44.\n 2","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". To proceed, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 2, 10","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With प्र प्र,\n 1. To begin to shine, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 1, 45, 5.\n 2","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":". To shine forth, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 3, 10054","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". प्रभात, Begun to become clear, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 2, 6, 10","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":". n. Daybreak, morning, Pañc. 246, 16; loc. ते, tomorrow, 119, 1.\n --Comp.\n --With संप्र सम्-प्र, To appear, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 3, 10055","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With प्रति प्रति,\n 1. To shine, Ghaṭ. 15.\n 2. To appear, Vikr. d. 23; "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 41, 23.\n 3","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". To please, Pañc. 78, 12; 151, 1; "},{"t":"cite","s":"Vikr. 43, 17","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":" (with acc.)\n --With संप्रति सम्-प्रति, To appear, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 8095","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With वि वि,\n 1. To shine, Vikr. d. 44; "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 294, 6","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":" = Rigv. i. 92, 6.\n 2. To appear, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Lass. 75, 2","q":"Lass"},{"t":"txt","s":". विभात, Become manifest, Vedāntas. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 217, 5","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". n. Daybreak.\n --Cf. ϕῶς, ϕωτός, ϕανός, ϕαλός, ἐμϕατικός, ἀμϕαδόν; probably, ϕοῖβος (for ϕοβ + ιος, from the Caus. भापय), ϕάος (for ϕαϝος), ϕαέθω, ϕαίνω (for ϕαϝέσνω), ϕαίδιμος, etc.; Lat. focus, februus (from the Causal)."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"2. भा भा,\n I. f.\n 1. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Light.\n 2","q":"Light.\n"},{"t":"txt","s":". Splendour.\n II. m. The sun."}]}]}]}